<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/caris-levert/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/caris-levert/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Caris LeVert’s Salary at Milwaukee in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"LeVert earns $14.81m in 2026-27, fifth at Milwaukee and the last year of his contract. It rises from $14.1m at Detroit last season. His career earnings reach $120.94m across eleven seasons. The salary is 9.23% of the club’s $160.39m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Caris LeVert Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract ends after this season. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in the summer of 2027 at 32, with eleven NBA seasons behind him."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Caris LeVert Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $14.81m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Caris LeVert’s Contract Worth at Milwaukee?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"LeVert is in the second year of a two-year contract worth $28.91m that he signed with Detroit in 2025 out of the non-taxpayer mid-level exception, fully guaranteed. Milwaukee took the contract on this summer. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2027 at 32."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Caris LeVert Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"LeVert’s net worth is estimated at around $48.37m, taken from his $120.94m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. He played four seasons at Michigan and went 20th in 2016, starting his career at Brooklyn. Milwaukee is his sixth club."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Caris LeVert Paid $14.81m?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"LeVert is paid $14.81m because a guard who creates his own shot off the bench is worth the mid-level exception, and he has been paid at roughly that level for six years. His salary has sat inside a $5m band for seven straight seasons."}}]}</script>
